1547 (Viktor 17.10.2026: «Вот цифровой шлюз в паблик, и обогати его по максимуму»): a step in Finish between the DAW and the Remaster (heresy-gate.js): a character (tape, console, tube, transformer, vinyl) and its own knobs only, eight starting points, the source any file of the tree, POST /lab/gate; its canvas node (fed by the take and the DAW, feeding the Remaster, clonable), its branch said in the tree and in the compare window.
1548 («допиши в Audio I/O возможность подключения второго устройства как Output/Monitor девайса… И не отключай нативный браузерный выход аудио»): the monitor in Audio I/O (device, rate, Keep, Tone, Stop); with one kept each row of the tree has «On Forge», from where its player stands.
1549 («Порогресс бары повсюду прикрути… как в Художнике… над плеером отцентрованно, примерно 800px»): heresy-progress.js, fed by the activity app.js already polls (a «heresy-activity» event).
1550 («нужно сравнить ДО и ПОСЛЕ»): each version's loudness (GET /lab/loudness) on its row; «Equal loudness» on by default, remembered.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
